{"type":"assistant_message","payload":{"text":"### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **`ui/src/components/NewTabPopover.tsx`**:\n   - Added optional callback props: `onNewMarkdown`, `onNewMobileEmulator`, and `onOpenSettings`.\n   - Rendered the complete 5-row target menu:\n     1. **New Terminal** (`⌘T` / `Ctrl+T`) — `TerminalSquare` icon, calls `onNewTerminal`\n     2. **New Browser Tab** (`⌘⇧B` / `Ctrl+Shift+B`) — `Globe` icon, calls `onNewBrowser`\n     3. **New Markdown** (`⌘⇧M` / `Ctrl+Shift+M`) — `FileText` icon, calls `onNewMarkdown` (rendered when prop provided)\n     4. **New Mobile Emulator** (`⌘⌥⇧E` / `Ctrl+Alt+Shift+E`) — `Smartphone` icon, calls `onNewMobileEmulator` (rendered when prop provided)\n     5. **Agent settings…** (no shortcut) — `Settings` icon, calls `onOpenSettings` (rendered when prop provided)\n   - Kept styling and class names consistent with existing rows.\n\n2. **`ui/src/components/TabBar.tsx`**:\n   - Added passthrough props `onAddMarkdown`, `onAddMobileEmulator`, and `onOpenSettings` to `TabBarProps`.\n   - Forwarded them to `NewTabPopover`.\n\n3. **`ui/src/components/TerminalSplitView.tsx`**:\n   - Added `onAddMarkdown`, `onAddMobileEmulator`, and `onOpenSettings` to `TerminalSplitViewProps` and `TabGroupViewProps` and forwarded down to `TabBar`.\n\n4. **`ui/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Defined `MARKDOWN_SCRATCH_HTML` and `MARKDOWN_SCRATCH_URL` as a self-contained data URL page (left textarea, right live preview with support for headings, bold, italic, code blocks/inline code, lists, and links; dark `#111` background).\n   - Wired `onAddMarkdown` handler: `createBrowserTab(MARKDOWN_SCRATCH_URL, \"Markdown\")`.\n   - Wired `onAddMobileEmulator` handler: creates browser tab (`https://www.apple.com`, `Mobile 390×844`), retrieves tab's `browserId` from state layout, and invokes `setBrowserBounds(browserId, { x: 0, y: 0, width: 390, height: 844 })`.\n   - Wired `onOpenSettings`: `() => setIsSettingsOpen(true)`.\n\n5. **`ui/src/components/NewTabPopover.test.tsx`**:\n   - Added unit tests asserting visibility when props are provided, omitting rows when optional props are absent, and verifying invocation of `onNewMarkdown`, `onNewMobileEmulator`, and `onOpenSettings`.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n- **`NewTabPopover.test.tsx`**: 8 passed (8 total)\n- **`TabBar.test.tsx`**: 12 passed (12 total)\n- **`TerminalSplitView.test.tsx`**: 9 passed (9 total)\n- **Build (`bun run --cwd ui build`)**: Exit code `0` (`tsc && vite build` succeeded)."}}
